Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.47,0:21:26.22,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}よふかしのうた
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.34,0:21:28.34,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}照らしてって moonlight
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.51,0:21:30.35,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}目を奪ってブルーライト
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.64,0:21:32.77,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}ネオンサインが呼ぶ表裏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.77,0:21:34.77,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}よふかしのうた
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.77,0:21:36.69,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}連れ去って midnight
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.85,0:21:38.60,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}血走った red eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.77,0:21:41.69,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}大人達の子守唄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.73,0:21:43.90,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}ガキの頃から夜が好きだった
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.90,0:21:45.95,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}9時に寝るのは何か嫌だった
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.95,0:21:48.07,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}なんと無くただ勿体無かった
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.07,0:21:50.20,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}お前の事がもっと知りたかった
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.74,0:21:52.49,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}いわゆる三文の得
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.49,0:21:55.41,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}投げ売ってでも見たいのさ もっと奥の奥の奥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.41,0:21:56.71,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}色濃く紐解く
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.71,0:21:58.92,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}12オクロックから丑の刻まで
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.00,0:22:00.88,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}初めてお前を跨いだのは、
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.96,0:22:03.67,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}いや初めて跨ったのは確か14
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.75,0:22:05.34,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}俺は何も知らねワナビー
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.34,0:22:07.42,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}手取り足取り全てが新しい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.42,0:22:08.51,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}姿形にその香り
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.51,0:22:11.26,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}静けさが似合うその黒い肌に
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.89,0:22:14.77,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}吸い込まれてた 手招きされるままに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:17.89,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}それからお前は音楽をくれた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.89,0:22:19.73,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}女の裸も見せてくれた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.81,0:22:22.06,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}飲んだ事ねぇ酒に口つけて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.19,0:22:24.11,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}オトンのタバコくすね火を付けた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.23,0:22:25.57,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}やっちゃいけないが溢れて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.57,0:22:27.57,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}知っちゃいけないに塗れてる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.11,0:22:29.82,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}迎えに来る闇に紛れて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.86,0:22:31.45,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}お前はいつも気まぐれで…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.45,0:22:33.28,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}よふかしのうた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.28,0:22:35.37,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}照らしてって moonlight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.37,0:22:37.20,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}目を奪ってブルーライト
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.29,0:22:39.46,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}ネオンサインが呼ぶ表裏
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.46,0:22:41.58,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}よふかしのうた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.58,0:22:43.46,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}連れ去って midnight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.46,0:22:45.71,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}血走った red eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.71,0:22:48.47,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}大人達の子守唄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.47,0:21:26.22,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}彻夜之歌
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.34,0:21:28.34,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}明亮的月光
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.51,0:21:30.35,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}夺目的蓝光
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.64,0:21:32.77,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}霓虹灯唤醒了内心的表里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.77,0:21:34.77,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}彻夜之歌
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.77,0:21:36.69,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}把我们带进深夜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.85,0:21:38.60,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}馋涎欲垂的赤瞳
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.77,0:21:41.69,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}大人们的摇篮曲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.73,0:21:43.90,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我从儿时就喜欢夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.90,0:21:45.95,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}不知为何不喜欢在九点睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.95,0:21:48.07,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}就是感觉很可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.07,0:21:50.20,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}想要更深入地了解你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.74,0:21:52.49,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}也就是所谓的占小便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.49,0:21:55.41,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}即使亏本也想继续深入地了解
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.41,0:21:56.71,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}了解的彻彻底底
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.71,0:21:58.92,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}从12点一直到丑时
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.00,0:22:00.88,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}第一次横跨是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.96,0:22:03.67,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}不对  第一次横跨是在14岁的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.75,0:22:05.34,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我是什么也不懂的wannabe
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.34,0:22:07.42,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}一切都对我来说是新鲜的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.42,0:22:08.51,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}你的姿态和气味
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.51,0:22:11.26,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}被你那融入寂静的黑色肌肤
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.89,0:22:14.77,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}所吸引  无法抵抗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:17.89,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}然后你给我推荐了音乐
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.89,0:22:19.73,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}也给我看了女人的赤裸
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.81,0:22:22.06,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}第一次喝了酒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.19,0:22:24.11,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}点了从爸爸那里偷的烟
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.23,0:22:25.57,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}干了太多不能干的事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.57,0:22:27.57,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}知道了不该知道的事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.11,0:22:29.82,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我被迎来的黑夜所吞噬
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.86,0:22:31.45,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}你却一直很随心所欲
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.45,0:22:33.28,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}彻夜之歌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.28,0:22:35.37,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}明亮的月光
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.37,0:22:37.20,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}夺目的蓝光
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.29,0:22:39.46,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}霓虹灯唤醒了内心的表里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.46,0:22:41.58,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}彻夜之歌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.58,0:22:43.46,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}把我们带进深夜
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.46,0:22:45.71,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}馋涎欲垂的赤瞳
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.71,0:22:48.47,EDCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}大人们的摇篮曲
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Comment,,0,0,0,,——Title——
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.91,0:15:00.92,Title,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(968,680)}第6夜:开心的不好吗
Comment: 0,0:00:01.02,0:00:01.02,Comment,,0,0,0,,——Text——
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.19,0:00:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,之前有醉鬼落了东西…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.61,0:00:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你让我在这里下车吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.61,0:00:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我送你到家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了  我有别的地方要去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.57,0:00:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,累了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,公司的酒会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.71,0:00:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不好的地方是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.25,0:00:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,很晚才能回家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.13,0:00:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至不如在公司工作
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.51,0:00:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么「这应该不是性骚扰吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.51,0:00:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.47,0:00:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,还说要送我回家  谁要你送啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.61,0:00:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,能感受到这种静寂算是酒会的好处吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.36,0:00:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那边…还开着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,睡不着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.75,0:01:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.88,0:01:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,声音大一点也可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.59,0:01:16.55,Comment,,0,0,0,,这里…这里好!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,去解解乏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.23,0:01:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.98,0:01:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,请进
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.78,0:01:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,如果帮我做了的话  我再亲你一口怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.16,0:01:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好慢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.67,0:01:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,开始吧  按摩套餐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.92,0:01:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,让我等了这么久
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.84,0:01:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,而且变得这么古怪!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,非常…不放心…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.77,0:03:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,可以说绝对不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.86,0:03:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,并不是想要小荠亲我才当陪睡的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.91,0:03:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,疼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.74,0:03:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不疼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.79,0:03:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,再用力一点也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.79,0:03:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.54,0:03:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我都使很大力气按了…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.13,0:04:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,关于光君的报酬…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.72,0:04:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,4000日元的一半
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.51,0:04:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,2000日元怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.09,0:04:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,工资给2000日元很吸引人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.39,0:04:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,因为是笔巨款
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.22,0:04:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟让小荠承担所有玩的开销  有点过意不去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要的是钱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.23,0:04:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,绝不是龌龊的想让她亲我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.11,0:04:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,才帮她陪睡的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.20,0:04:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,小荠估计是误会了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.70,0:04:29.45,Comment,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.49,0:04:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟她既不检点又厚脸皮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.66,0:04:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,真让人伤脑筋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.75,0:04:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,也许会冒犯你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.63,0:04:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.67,0:04:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,您看起来很年轻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.71,0:04:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,您今年多大?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,十四岁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,您可以起来一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.34,0:04:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.69,0:04:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,什么  十四?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.27,0:05:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.61,0:05:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,初中生?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.03,0:05:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  已经初二了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.90,0:05:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,初二…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我初中的时候可没有打过工
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.12,0:05:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是今天才开始的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是有什么不好说的隐情吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.46,0:05:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不应该说刚才那一句
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.84,0:05:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要打工啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.84,0:05:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,要说为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.43,0:05:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,想要钱?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.47,0:05:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不是亲吻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.89,0:05:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,果然是不太好说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.06,0:05:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,之后嘛…对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.02,0:05:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,有想做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.77,0:05:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,想做的事是指?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.57,0:05:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我因为不去学校  不怎么活动
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.95,0:05:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,就睡不着了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.70,0:05:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道怎么想的  第一次半夜独自一人出门
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:05:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,该怎么讲呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然是每天都走的路
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,只因为是晚上  就感到很兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.34,0:06:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想失去这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.68,0:06:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,想要享受夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.14,0:06:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道我表达得对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.10,0:06:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.11,0:06:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这边…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不是市中心  车不多
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.03,0:06:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,比如在马路中间散散步…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.78,0:06:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,对对  就感觉很自由
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.20,0:06:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,再比如大声唱歌
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.37,0:06:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,然后发现附近有人就很害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,当我在你这个年纪时  也是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.09,0:06:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,已经是十年前了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.72,0:06:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次在晚上出门
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.01,0:06:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,在便利店买了肉包子和茶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.35,0:07:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这个地方只属于我的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,已经忘记很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.36,0:07:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那个  我的名字是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.53,0:07:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,小…店长跟我说了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.74,0:07:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,白河小姐  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.82,0:07:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫夜守光
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.95,0:07:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不去学校呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.79,0:07:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,因为觉得很无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.71,0:07:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来伸出您的小手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.50,0:07:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,小手…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.42,0:07:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,别看我现在这样  我还算是个优等生来着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.51,0:07:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,就是…感觉累到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.68,0:07:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,优等生在晚上沦落成现在这样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.69,0:07:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有点累了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.86,0:07:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所以来这家陪睡店了?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.86,0:07:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.19,0:07:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我很享受工作本身
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.40,0:07:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但是工作必须跟其他人打交道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.03,0:07:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,冲啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.49,0:08:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,比如跟上司  同事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.25,0:08:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,要一直保持开心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.21,0:08:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,还得陪别人笑…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.05,0:08:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.55,0:08:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,早就忘记了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.18,0:08:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了了!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,公司和酒会我都不想去啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.98,0:08:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.65,0:08:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,来电
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.65,0:08:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,经理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.41,0:08:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是上司
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.95,0:08:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我得回公司
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.79,0:08:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.08,0:08:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他总是在这个时候叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.33,0:08:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不去的话会被骂的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.21,0:08:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.29,0:08:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,今天就这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.17,0:08:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么让她走了  真的好吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.05,0:08:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟她自己说要去…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.89,0:09:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,话说现在让她走了的话我就拿不到工资了…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.60,0:09:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不对  这不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.23,0:09:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.94,0:09:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人是我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.82,0:09:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,和我一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.78,0:09:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,夜守  你能走开一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.66,0:09:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不行  不能让你走
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.91,0:09:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须给我在这里睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.79,0:09:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,按摩还没结束
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,必须让你熬夜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.29,0:09:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,小荠
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.34,0:09:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你靠着门干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我有事要拜托你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.43,0:09:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,别让她…去公司!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.60,0:09:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.22,0:09:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,别问了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.02,0:09:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,让她去不了公司就行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.65,0:09:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,开窗户  光君
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.40,0:09:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.02,0:09:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,走你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.69,0:09:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,扔出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.74,0:09:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,太随意了!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.28,0:10:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.04,0:10:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.67,0:10:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我要死了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这是要死了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.67,0:10:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会死的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.69,0:10:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  不会死
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.65,0:10:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,吓得我没有力气了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.49,0:10:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.28,0:10:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定有事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.32,0:10:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,清澄小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.99,0:10:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉刚才对你很粗暴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.33,0:10:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我认为无论如何也不能让你离开
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.75,0:10:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我不想让你离开
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.59,0:10:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.88,0:10:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你哭了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.67,0:11:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,既然这么讨厌就不要做了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.34,0:11:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是孩子所以不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.89,0:11:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这是工作  是公司
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.56,0:11:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,和学校不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.94,0:11:13.52,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\an7\fs35\bord1.5\c&H6D6D6D&\3c&HFFFEFC&}紧急!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.15,0:11:18.11,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\an7\fs35\bord1.5\c&H6D6D6D&\3c&HFFFEFC&}紧急!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.52,0:11:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,上司叫我的话  我就必须得去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.78,0:11:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的大人即使想哭也得承受
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.41,0:11:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  那种事情…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.03,0:11:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,小荠
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.45,0:11:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我想变成吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.79,0:11:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.25,0:11:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,小荠是吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让她把我变成吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.30,0:11:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你至少能看出来她不是人类吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,正如你所说  我是个小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.80,0:11:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,对公司和社会一无所知
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.81,0:11:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我很天真
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.48,0:11:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,又不正经
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.65,0:11:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,可是在这个时间叫你的上司更不正经
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.98,0:12:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,现在可是早上两点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.53,0:12:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,如果都不正经  那选开心的不好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.03,0:12:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,而且吸血鬼不需要很正经
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.41,0:12:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟不是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.46,0:12:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,太荒唐了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.96,0:12:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他想成为吸血鬼是因为想享受夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.34,0:12:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不过…好羡慕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.64,0:12:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这话说得
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.64,0:12:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你可真有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.85,0:12:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,啊  那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么在笑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.23,0:12:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟…你想成为吸血鬼的理由…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.15,0:12:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,也太荒谬了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.61,0:12:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.57,0:12:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.57,0:12:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟我说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.49,0:12:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,能在马路中间散步
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.21,0:12:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这太上瘾了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.67,0:12:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.10,0:13:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.06,0:13:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,越不让做的事情  不知道为什么就越开心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是你也不正经
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.77,0:13:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你可真敢说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.11,0:13:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我不能一直这样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.54,0:13:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我是大人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.08,0:13:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是去公司吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟是规定
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你已经让我很放松了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.26,0:13:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,祝愿你能变成吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.22,0:13:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,真好啊  我也…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.85,0:13:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,白河小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:13:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我能变成吸血鬼的话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.65,0:14:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我就把你也变成吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.74,0:14:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,随时都能放弃人类身份
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.74,0:14:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能这么想  心情更舒畅吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.54,0:14:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你说话说得这么果断
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.63,0:14:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,啊  为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.55,0:14:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,首先你都不知道自己能否变成吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.43,0:14:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让她变成你的眷属的话得…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.98,0:14:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.14,0:14:42.48,Comment,,0,0,0,,她得爱上我  对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.23,0:14:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不要说「爱上我」这种话啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.77,0:14:47.44,Comment,,0,0,0,,没事  毕竟我还是挺受欢迎的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.74,0:14:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,呃…好恶心…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.92,0:15:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上…好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.17,0:15:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  想一个好玩的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.09,0:15:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来像一个有权利的恶人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.59,0:15:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,偶尔你也想一想嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.22,0:15:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,每天都一样  你不腻吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.35,0:15:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,去唱歌?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.60,0:15:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我现在不想去唱歌  但是就是这个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.27,0:15:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,看电影?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.60,0:15:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,电影啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.27,0:15:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏厅
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.31,0:15:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不错  但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.90,0:15:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,飞镖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.07,0:15:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,滑板
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.03,0:15:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你没滑过吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.57,0:15:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,变魔术
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.41,0:15:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我说啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.57,0:15:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,夜…夜间泳池呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.45,0:15:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,夜间泳池  你认真的?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.00,0:15:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.29,0:15:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨炸了吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.00,0:15:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,小荠变成派对狂了!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.38,0:15:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,原来光君是天才阳光男孩!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.34,0:15:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗  太好了!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.25,0:15:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我等不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.71,0:15:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,快打扮的漂漂亮亮的赶过去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.01,0:15:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我只有这身外套啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.69,0:16:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我第一个感想是「原来夜间泳池真的是这样的」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.28,0:16:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我想起来我没有任何泳装
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.87,0:16:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不过店里有借给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.29,0:16:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,原来有这样的夜晚和夜生活
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.46,0:16:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是大人的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.79,0:16:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,明明都是泳池
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.42,0:16:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但是跟学校的不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.76,0:16:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,有一种奇特的氛围…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,小荠穿的什么泳装
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.31,0:16:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我有点期待…吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.19,0:16:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不过她平常衣服里面穿的就是泳装吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.48,0:16:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉亏了点什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.57,0:16:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哟  让你久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.41,0:16:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,哟  你怎么无精打采的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.08,0:17:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这算什么泳装
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.41,0:17:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,在里面穿了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.17,0:17:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我去拿点喝的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.59,0:17:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这里还能喝酒呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.13,0:17:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.64,0:17:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,讲道理比平常露的还少
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.60,0:17:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,却感觉…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.02,0:17:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么比平常还刺激?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.31,0:17:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你看  那个人太好看了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.82,0:17:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,真的呀  太好看了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.53,0:17:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,真的有长得像娃娃一样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.20,0:17:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,她就一个人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.11,0:17:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.95,0:17:42.33,Comment,,0,0,0,,服务员  来一杯啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.53,0:17:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,小荠果然是很好看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.83,0:17:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,她之前虽然说过吸血鬼长得都好看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.71,0:17:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,但是总感觉心里有个疙瘩…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.18,0:18:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,有好多人在说话…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.93,0:18:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,哟  小姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.14,0:18:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.10,0:18:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你好好看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.02,0:18:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我也感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,在…在搭讪!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.81,0:18:10.98,Comment,,0,0,0,,你从哪里来的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.02,0:18:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,原来真的有人会搭讪!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:12.02,Comment,,0,0,0,,现在几岁了?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.19,0:18:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,搭讪是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.61,0:18:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我跟人一起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.28,0:18:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.41,0:18:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真扫兴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.99,0:18:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,恭平你一定可以的!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.33,0:18:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,一起来玩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.75,0:18:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你请我喝的话  倒是可以考虑一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.71,0:18:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.84,0:18:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你来的人呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道  可能走了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.72,0:18:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能这样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.13,0:18:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我们平时很懒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.18,0:18:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,从来不搭讪的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.06,0:18:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,对对对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.89,0:18:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,她在想什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.23,0:18:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,在搞什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.10,0:18:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,所以说我想跟你做个朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.54,0:19:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,对不住啊  他没走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.13,0:19:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.05,0:19:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是有人跟她来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,别让女孩自己一个人走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.55,0:19:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,加油  少年
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.89,0:19:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  别生气了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.06,0:19:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是开了个玩笑而已
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.81,0:19:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,光君!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.82,0:19:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,夜间泳池
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.57,0:19:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,只是有很多人  并不好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.53,0:19:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,听别人对你的评价很无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.50,0:19:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,人多让我也感到很累
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.88,0:19:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,看到别人想跟你做朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.59,0:20:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉有点…难受
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.85,0:20:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,光君
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.14,0:20:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,要不我们再去泳池?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.69,0:20:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我就算了…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.19,0:20:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,别咬到舌头了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.48,0:20:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事  我好害怕!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.28,0:20:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你快看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.49,0:20:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是泳池
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.08,0:20:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我们学校的泳池吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.62,0:20:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,吓死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.64,0:20:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不过很有意思吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.90,0:20:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,光君  对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.82,0:21:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我又捉弄你了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.70,0:21:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒是…不在意
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.57,0:21:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我是怎么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.75,0:21:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,问小荠的话  她会告诉我吗
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Comment,,0,0,0,,
